004	NUM	026	004	“Tarai andũ arĩa makinyĩtie mĩaka mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ na makĩria, o ta ũrĩa Jehova aathĩte Musa.” Aya nĩo andũ a Isiraeli arĩa moimire bũrũri wa Misiri:
