026	EZE	039	014	“‘Nao andũ nĩmakaheagwo wĩra wa gũtheragia bũrũri ũcio. Amwe magaathiĩ bũrũri ũcio kũndũ guothe, na mongererwo angĩ a gũthikaga ciimba iria igaakorwo itigaire kũu. Mĩeri ĩyo mũgwanja yathira-rĩ, nĩguo makaambĩrĩria gũcaria matigari macio.
